{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Step on now?|No — let them off first."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong way."},{"id":"s3","text":"Board now?|Never."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same doors.|New move."},{"id":"s5","text":"Wait in line.|Let them off."},{"id":"s6","text":"She pointed—"},{"id":"s7","text":"They stream off.|We stand still."},{"id":"s8","text":"Now board.|Smooth and easy."},{"id":"s9","text":"Off first,|on second."},{"id":"n1","text":"The floor lines|mark your spot."},{"id":"n2","text":"Off first.|Then board."},{"id":"n3","text":"No pushing.|No rushing."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}